  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Refugee Council - Energy Reconstruction Package 5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to restore access to and functionality of critical infrastructure and public services through the provision of hybrid and sustainable energy systems, improving energy security in Ukraine in frontline oblasts with the most critical needs. The outcomes of the project include protecting and restoring water and sewage supply systems in areas affected by energy infrastructure damage and destruction through the provision of hybrid and sustainable systems. Moreover, the project will result in supporting infrastructure in urban and peri-urban areas affected by energy infrastructure damage through the provision of hybrid and sustainable systems.</narrative>
  </description>
